der axis.\n2 Major axis is perpendicular to cylinder axis.\n3 First true ellipse; semi-axes20 and11.547mm.\n4 Next center50mm along axis; second ellipse.\n5 Join tangent generators and line visible outline.\nRear true ellipse trimmed to local180-360 degrees.\nCenter guides retained; no circle-arc approximation.\nChosen paper dimensions; no manufactured part.","leader":null},{"id":"n4v71rut","x":45.71646858272117,"y":83.84092902529845,"text":"CIRCLE ROTATION PROJECTION (chosen diameter24mm)\nLeft to right:0,45,75,90,105,135,180 degrees.\nMajor semi-axis12mm; minor12*abs(cos(angle)).\nAt90 degrees the edge-on circle projects as a line.\nNative analytic ellipses, no polygon approximation.","leader":null}],"primitives":[{"id":"ph1ky5tb","type":"ellipse","points":[{"x":100,"y":180},{"x":114.14213562373095,"y":194.14213562373095},{"x":91.83503419071745,"y":188.16496580928256}],"style":"outline"},{"id":"pncdxjs0","type":"ellipse","points":[{"x":135.355339,"y":144.644661},{"x":149.49747462373094,"y":158.78679662373096},{"x":127.19037319071742,"y":152.80962680928258}],"style":"outline","startAngle":180,"endAngle":360},{"id":"p030grpw","type":"line","points":[{"x":82.32233047,"y":162.32233047},{"x":117.67766953,"y":197.67766953}],"style":"center"},{"id":"pp8wyjk0","type":"line","points":[{"x":89.39339828,"y":190.60660172},{"x":110.60660172,"y":169.39339828}],"style":"center"},{"id":"pgn1zqu4","type":"line","points":[{"x":117.67766947,"y":126.96699147},{"x":153.03300853,"y":162.32233053}],"style":"center"},{"id":"p2e4igv7","type":"line","points":[{"x":124.74873728,"y":155.25126272},{"x":145.96194072,"y":134.03805928}],"style":"center"},{"id":"pal0vis5","type":"line","points":[{"x":100,"y":180},{"x":135.355339,"y":144.644661}],"style":"center"},{"id":"pk81snx6","type":"line","points":[{"x":114.142135624,"y":194.142135624},{"x":149.497474624,"y":158.786796624}],"style":"outline"},{"id":"pzwebdv4","type":"line","points":[{"x":85.857864376,"y":165.857864376},{"x":121.213203376,"y"